      ],
      "text": "2.3.3 Concurrent use of tests in children with HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        492.2799987792969,
        75.86139678955078,
        515.6900024414062,
        87.56139373779297
      ],
      "text": "NEW",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        97.07283020019531,
        192.72633361816406,
        113.45283508300781
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        135.70582580566406,
        512.3682250976562,
        148.6198272705078
      ],
      "text": "9.\t For children with HIV who have signs or symptoms or screen positive for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41439819335938,
        151.20582580566406,
        512.3693237304688,
        164.1198272705078
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB, concurrent testing using low-complexity automated NAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.988694190979004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41439819335938,
        166.70582580566406,
        512.3785400390625,
        179.6198272705078
      ],
      "text": "respiratory and stool samples and LF-LAM on urine may be used as the initial",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41439819335938,
        182.20582580566406,
        512.3345947265625,
        195.1198272705078
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic strategy for diagnosing TB rather than low-complexity automated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41439819335938,
        197.70582580566406,
        343.3282165527344,
        210.6198272705078
      ],
      "text": "NAATs on respiratory or stool samples alone.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        221.7427978515625,
        460.80499267578125,
        234.62379455566406
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, low certainty of evidence for test accuracy)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        257.05560302734375,
        120.02171325683594,
        271.1435852050781
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.84649658203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        294.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        281.84649658203125,
        526.986083984375,
        294.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation prioritizes concurrent testing over the use of molecular testing and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        297.34649658203125,
        373.1024169921875,
        310.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "LF-LAM in isolation for diagnosis of TB in children with HIV.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.84649658203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        325.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        312.84649658203125,
        526.9653930664062,
        325.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "Use of LC-aNAATs on isolated specimens was also evaluated. The findings supported the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        328.34649658203125,
        527.0081787109375,
        341.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "use of LC-aNAATs for initial diagnostic testing for TB in HIV-positive children with signs or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        343.84649658203125,
        526.9642944335938,
        356.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "symptoms or who screen positive for pulmonary TB, using sputum, gastric aspirate, stool or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        359.34649658203125,
        351.6318664550781,
        372.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "nasopharyngeal aspirate, rather than smear or culture.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.84649658203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        387.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        374.84649658203125,
        526.964111328125,
        387.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is conditional because the findings indicate moderate undesirable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        390.34649658203125,
        526.7315673828125,
        403.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "effects (i.e. decreased specificity, resulting in more false positive test results) when compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.962586402893066,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        405.84649658203125,
        212.79161071777344,
        418.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "with a single test strategy.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.34649658203125,
        78.81909942626953,
        434.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        421.34649658203125,
        527.1843872070312,
        434.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "The product for which eligible data met the LC-aNAAT class-based performance criteria",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        436.84649658203125,
        526.9532470703125,
        449.99151611328125
      ],
      "text": "for this recommendation was Xpert MTB/RIF Ultra. The performance of Truenat MTB Plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        452.34649658203125,
        524.4104614257812,
        465.49151611328125
      ],
      "text": "and MTB-RIF Dx for this recommendation could not be assessed, as data were unavailable.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.6927185058594,
        239.91468811035156,
        497.07269287109375
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.32373046875,
        527.1416015625,
        520.46875
      ],
      "text": "LC-aNAATs on respiratory and stool sample and LF-LAM on urine are recommended as the first",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980783462524414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.82373046875,
        526.9479370117188,
        535.96875
      ],
      "text": "test for symptomatic children with HIV presenting with presumptive TB disease, and should",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        538.32373046875,
        187.31060791015625,
        551.46875
      ],
      "text": "be used to diagnose TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.32763671875,
        526.9371948242188,
        575.47265625
      ],
      "text": "Previous systematic reviews have traditionally assessed diagnostic accuracy of LC-aNAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.82763671875,
        526.965576171875,
        590.97265625
      ],
      "text": "two samples and LF-LAM on urine in isolation for the detection of TB in children, but in clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.32763671875,
        526.9810791015625,
        606.47265625
      ],
      "text": "practice the tests may be used concurrently (i.e. LC-aNAAT on a respiratory and stool sample",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.82763671875,
        363.9900817871094,
        621.97265625
      ],
      "text": "and LF-LAM on urine) and together they increase sensitivity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.3391723632812,
        279.74468994140625,
        650.7191772460938
      ],
      "text": "Incremental diagnostic accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.953857421875,
        510.3663330078125,
        676.0418090820312
      ],
      "text": "What is the incremental diagnostic accuracy of concurrent use of LC-aNAATs on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.3538208007812,
        494.0990905761719,
        690.4417724609375
      ],
      "text": "respiratory and stool samples and LF-LAM on urine versus each sample type",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.7538452148438,
        515.107421875,
        704.841796875
      ],
      "text": "alone for diagnosis of pulmonary TB disease in children with HIV, with signs and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.15380859375,
        521.3870239257812,
        719.2417602539062
      ],
      "text": "symptoms or who screened positive for pulmonary TB, compared with any of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.5538330078125,
        362.2514343261719,
        733.6417846679688
      ],
      "text": "tests (either LC-aNAATs combined or LF-LAM) alone?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        744.3087158203125,
        526.9508056640625,
        757.4537353515625
      ],
      "text": "Based on six studies (653 participants, including 43 [6.6%] with TB) included in the meta-analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.8087158203125,
        527.2489013671875,
        772.9537353515625
      ],
      "text": "for an MRS, the estimated diagnostic accuracy of the concurrent use of LC-aNAAT on respiratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.950287818908691,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "66 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}